# Repository-level line-ending policy (added Phase 3F).
#
# Normalize text files to LF in the repository index while the working
# tree may be CRLF on Windows (core.autocrlf=true).  This prevents the
# phantom "every file modified" state that occurs when a checkout's CRLF
# files are compared against LF blobs under a differing core.autocrlf.
#
# This is a minimal, convention-preserving rule set.  It does NOT rewrite
# any existing file; it only guides future checkouts / renormalization.

* text=auto

# Large IQ binary recordings must never be normalized or treated as text.
*.dat binary

# Generated / vendored artifacts kept as-is.
*.grc text
*.py text
*.md text
